+// ---------------------------------------------------------------
+// DIRECT MODE (no table): sign in once with phone (+ optional name), then the
+// full menu is always the first screen. Ordering from here arrives in Phase 2
+// (docs/PLAN-DEDICATED-CUSTOMER-APP.md); until then the cart offers a chooser.
